1
00:00:00,536 --> 00:00:02,606
Oh, the people are heartbroken!

2
00:00:04,573 --> 00:00:07,073
(Sheldon:)I can't take this away
from the world!

3
00:00:07,076 --> 00:00:10,006
Fun with Flags is back!

4
00:00:10,012 --> 00:00:12,012
(Leonard:)Congratulations.

5
00:00:12,014 --> 00:00:13,884
Let's celebrate!

6
00:00:13,882 --> 00:00:15,512
(cork pops)

7
00:00:15,517 --> 00:00:18,117
(Sheldon:)Sheldon,

8
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,850
that wasn't for you!

9
00:00:19,855 --> 00:00:21,425
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, I'm not going
to drink it.

10
00:00:21,423 --> 00:00:22,623
(Sheldon:)I just wanted to hear the pop.

11
00:00:23,859 --> 00:00:27,299
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I knew it was coming.
Still scary.

12
00:00:36,805 --> 00:00:38,935
(Sheldon:)LeVar Burton?

13
00:00:38,941 --> 00:00:40,741
LeVar Burton!

14
00:00:40,742 --> 00:00:42,242
LeVar Burton!

15
00:00:42,244 --> 00:00:45,884
(LeVar:)Ugh. What are you doing here?

16
00:00:45,881 --> 00:00:47,411
(Sheldon:)You told me not to call,

17
00:00:47,416 --> 00:00:49,646
(Sheldon:)and I didn't know how else
to give you the good news.

18
00:00:49,651 --> 00:00:53,251
(Sheldon:)Fun with Flags is back, and
you can be in the next episode.

19
00:00:53,255 --> 00:00:54,825
(LeVar:)Wil Wheaton said, get a gate.

20
00:00:54,823 --> 00:00:57,253
(LeVar:)I don't know why
I didn't get a gate.
You...

21
00:00:57,259 --> 00:00:59,789
(Sheldon:)At least listen
to the premise.

22
00:00:59,795 --> 00:01:01,265
(Sheldon:)Since you were born
in Germany,

23
00:01:01,263 --> 00:01:04,333
(Sheldon:)I thought we could talk
about German flags.

24
00:01:04,333 --> 00:01:08,403
How do you feel about
dressing up like a swastika?

